997082.description:
@req:403@
@req:8232@
Transforms Lightning Bolt into |cFFFFFFFFDesolate Wind Bolt|r. 

Triggering Windfury causes a |cFFFFFFFFDesolate Dust Devil|r to surround your target and grants you a stack of |cFFFFFFFFDesolate Winds|r.

Desolate Dust Devil lasts 8 seconds. Each landed Desolate Wind Bolt extends your existing Desolate Dust Devil by 2 seconds, up to a maximum of 12 seconds remaining. Extending it does not reset its damage tick timer.

Does not work with Elemental Destruction.
